rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/obsproject/obs-studio/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/obsproject/obs-studio/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/obsproject/obs-studio/deployments","created_at":"2013-10-01T02:40:31Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:03:06Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T00:44:28Z","git_url":"git://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:obsproject/obs-studio.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio","homepage":"https://obsproject.com","size":78691,"stargazers_count":68667,"watchers_count":68667,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":8873,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1052,"license":{"key":"gpl-2.0","name":"GNU General Public License v2.0","spdx_id":"GPL-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/gpl-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTg="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["c","c-plus-plus","directshow","facebook-live","ffmpeg","game-capture","live-streaming","screen-capture","twitch-tv","video-recording","youtube-live"],"visibility":"public","forks":8873,"open_issues":1052,"watchers":68667,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/obsproject/obs-studio/pulls/2858","html_url":"https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/2858","diff_url":"https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/2858.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/2858.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### Description\r\nFixes #2416 \r\nBuild replay filename formatting so that it mimics regular recordings and applies the prefix and suffix to only the filename.\r\n\r\n### Motivation and Context\r\nUsers expect recordings and replays to follow the same filename formatting, but instead replays silently ignore directories by swapping `\\\\` or `/` with `_`.\r\n\r\n### How Has This Been Tested?\r\nThe following was done in both simple and advanced output modes. OS is Windows 10 2004.\r\n\r\nSet `Replay Buffer Filename Prefix` to `Prefix` and `Replay Buffer Filename Suffix` to `Suffix`.\r\n\r\nLeft `Filename Formatting` to its default of `%CCYY-%MM-%DD %hh-%mm-%ss` and tested that the output file used `Prefix  %CCYY-%MM-%DD %hh-%mm-%ss Suffix`.\r\n\r\nSet `Filename Formatting` to `%CCYY-%MM-%DD/%hh-%mm-%ss` and tested that the output file used `%CCYY-%MM-%DD/Prefix %hh-%mm-%ss Suffix`.\r\n\r\n Set `Filename Formatting` to `%CCYY-%MM-%DD\\%hh-%mm-%ss` and tested that the output file used `%CCYY-%MM-%DD/Prefix %hh-%mm-%ss Suffix`.\r\n\r\n Set `Prefix` to `Prefix/` and tested that the output file used `%CCYY-%MM-%DD/Prefix/%hh-%mm-%ss Suffix`.\r\n\r\nSet `Prefix` to `///Prefix/` and tested that the output file used `%CCYY-%MM-%DD/Prefix/%hh-%mm-%ss Suffix`.\r\n\r\n Set `Suffix` to `Suffix/` and tested that the output file used `%CCYY-%MM-%DD/Prefix/%hh-%mm-%ss Suffix_`. ( I'm not sure why a user would ever do this, but at least it won't crash)\r\n\r\n Set `Suffix` to `/Suffix/` and tested that the output file used `%CCYY-%MM-%DD/Prefix/%hh-%mm-%ss/Suffix_`.\r\n\r\n### Types of changes\r\n- Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\r\n- Code cleanup (non-breaking change which makes code smaller or more readable)\r\n\r\n### Checklist:\r\n- [x] My code has been run through [clang-format](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/blob/master/.clang-format).\r\n- [x] I have read the [**contributing** document](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.rst).\r\n- [x] My code is not on the master branch.\r\n- [x] The code has been tested.\r\n- [x] All commit messages are properly formatted and commits squashed where appropriate.","reactions":{"url":"htt